{"4158030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call of Donuts", "steam_appid": 4158030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Sweet Land!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Candy King has stolen the Sweet Star and a terrible curse has fallen over Sweet Land: all the candy now tastes bitter! Follow Nibbles into this crazy sugary realm in <strong>Call of Donuts,</strong> a fast-paced 3rd-person shooter where you must blast your way through danger to recover the good taste of candy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Risk, Reward, and Sugar Rushes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo isn't free! You'll need to brave procedurally generated traps to collect coins and fund your cannon. Master the art of the loot run: collecting multiple coins at once grants a massive bonus gold multiplier. Because the traps change every time, no two runs are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/3eef054e818aa288bbce3b976f622283.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/3eef054e818aa288bbce3b976f622283.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/3eef054e818aa288bbce3b976f622283.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Deliciously Destructive Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your cannon with 4 unique types of candy projectiles, each with its own strategic advantage:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cherry Candy:</strong> Your trusty normal attack for raw damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donut:</strong> Slow down your enemies and disable their shields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lollipop:</strong> Stick it to them with devastating Damage Over Time (DoT).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Hole Candy:</strong> Bend space to instantly teleport across the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Want more power?</i> Mix and match your abilities to unleash <strong>devastating combos</strong> that melt through enemy defenses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/b545a29f1d14fdc86b7005b46c154715.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/b545a29f1d14fdc86b7005b46c154715.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/b545a29f1d14fdc86b7005b46c154715.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crunchy Defenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low on stamina and taking heat? Quickly build a Biscuit Wall to block incoming fire and give yourself a moment to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/eee66d421916e36b73fee59a84bcc14c.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/eee66d421916e36b73fee59a84bcc14c.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/eee66d421916e36b73fee59a84bcc14c.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race for the Edge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is everything! Be the first team to secure map checkpoints to earn bonus stats and gain a crucial early advantage over your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/f2724efff3efe57d4cb92d09383e6dfb.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/f2724efff3efe57d4cb92d09383e6dfb.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/f2724efff3efe57d4cb92d09383e6dfb.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo Speedruns or Multiplayer Mayhem!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way! Take on the hordes solo and race against the clock, or bring your friends into the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Party Battles:</strong> Join forces or face off in up to 8 teams (1–3 players per team).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the AI:</strong> Don't expect your enemies to just stand there. You'll face highly intelligent minions that actively predict your moves and try to outflank you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Customizations:</strong> Stand out in the crowd with hilarious character customization options designed for ultimate party-game fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/5a233ef49b6b8231faffdefd14d80dc2.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/389d6b640290d548c5a0d0d70bb96632.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get ready to power up, grab your cannon, and go BANG!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Sweet Land!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Candy King has stolen the Sweet Star and a terrible curse has fallen over Sweet Land: all the candy now tastes bitter! Follow Nibbles into this crazy sugary realm in <strong>Call of Donuts,</strong> a fast-paced 3rd-person shooter where you must blast your way through danger to recover the good taste of candy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Risk, Reward, and Sugar Rushes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo isn't free! You'll need to brave procedurally generated traps to collect coins and fund your cannon. Master the art of the loot run: collecting multiple coins at once grants a massive bonus gold multiplier. Because the traps change every time, no two runs are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/3eef054e818aa288bbce3b976f622283.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/3eef054e818aa288bbce3b976f622283.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/3eef054e818aa288bbce3b976f622283.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Deliciously Destructive Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your cannon with 4 unique types of candy projectiles, each with its own strategic advantage:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cherry Candy:</strong> Your trusty normal attack for raw damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donut:</strong> Slow down your enemies and disable their shields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lollipop:</strong> Stick it to them with devastating Damage Over Time (DoT).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Hole Candy:</strong> Bend space to instantly teleport across the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Want more power?</i> Mix and match your abilities to unleash <strong>devastating combos</strong> that melt through enemy defenses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/b545a29f1d14fdc86b7005b46c154715.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/b545a29f1d14fdc86b7005b46c154715.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/b545a29f1d14fdc86b7005b46c154715.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crunchy Defenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low on stamina and taking heat? Quickly build a Biscuit Wall to block incoming fire and give yourself a moment to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/eee66d421916e36b73fee59a84bcc14c.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/eee66d421916e36b73fee59a84bcc14c.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/eee66d421916e36b73fee59a84bcc14c.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race for the Edge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is everything! Be the first team to secure map checkpoints to earn bonus stats and gain a crucial early advantage over your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/f2724efff3efe57d4cb92d09383e6dfb.poster.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/f2724efff3efe57d4cb92d09383e6dfb.webm?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/f2724efff3efe57d4cb92d09383e6dfb.mp4?t=1787756691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo Speedruns or Multiplayer Mayhem!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way! Take on the hordes solo and race against the clock, or bring your friends into the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Party Battles:</strong> Join forces or face off in up to 8 teams (1–3 players per team).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the AI:</strong> Don't expect your enemies to just stand there. You'll face highly intelligent minions that actively predict your moves and try to outflank you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny Customizations:</strong> Stand out in the crowd with hilarious character customization options designed for ultimate party-game fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/5a233ef49b6b8231faffdefd14d80dc2.avif?t=1787756691\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158030/extras/389d6b640